# Code owners for the annot monorepo.
#
# GitHub uses this file to auto-request reviews on opened PRs.
# The path patterns are matched in order, with later rules winning,
# so the catch-all `*` rule lives at the top and per-area overrides
# (when they're added) sit below it.
#
# Today this is a single-maintainer project, so every path resolves
# to one reviewer. As reviewers join, add per-area lines:
#
#   /packages/extension/      @ingmrn @<extension-maintainer>
#   /packages/desktop/        @ingmrn @<desktop-maintainer>
#   /docs/plans/              @ingmrn  # plans changes only need
#                                       # one reviewer
#
# Keep CONTRIBUTING.md, CLAUDE.md, and the LICENSE owned by the
# project lead even when the rest is shared, since those define
# the project's contract with contributors.

*                           @ingmrn

# Conventions, contract documents, and licensing — always reviewed
# by the project lead.
/CLAUDE.md                  @ingmrn
/CONTRIBUTING.md            @ingmrn
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md         @ingmrn
/SECURITY.md                @ingmrn
/LICENSE                    @ingmrn
/PRODUCT_DIRECTION.md       @ingmrn
/docs/plans/                @ingmrn
